<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DDS - Dark Digital Space</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: #0a0e1a;
            color: #e4e7ec;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
            animation: bgShift 20s ease infinite;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        @keyframes bgShift {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1) translateY(-20px); }
        }

        nav {
            background: rgba(10, 14, 26, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1a2234;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            animation: slideDown 0.5s ease;
        }

        @keyframes slideDown {
            from { transform: translateY(-100%); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .logo:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: #9ca3af;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-links a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -5px;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: #3b82f6;
            transition: width 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #fff;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .mobile-toggle {
            display: none;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .hero {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 6rem 1.5rem 4rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #3b82f6);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: #9ca3af;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease 0.2s both;
        }

        .hero-highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1));
            border-left: 3px solid #3b82f6;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
            max-width: 700px;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease 0.6s both;
        }

        .hero-highlight p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .hero-highlight strong {
            color: #3b82f6;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease 0.4s both;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .btn::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            width: 0;
            height: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            transition: width 0.6s, height 0.6s;
        }

        .btn:hover::before {
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
        }

        .btn span {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #3b82f6;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #2563eb;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: #1a2234;
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #2d3748;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: #2d3748;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        section {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;
        }

        .section-subtitle {
            color: #9ca3af;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease 0.2s forwards;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .grid-3 {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
        }

        .card {
            background: #111827;
            border: 1px solid #1f2937;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 2rem;
            transition: all 0.4s;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
            animation: cardFadeIn 0.6s ease forwards;
        }

        .card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
        .card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        .card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .card:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
        .card:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

        @keyframes cardFadeIn {
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover .card-title {
            color: #3b82f6;
        }

        .card-text {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }

        .stat-item {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1));
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .stat-item:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            border-color: #3b82f6;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #3b82f6;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .stat-label {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .team-card {
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .team-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -2px;
            left: -2px;
            right: -2px;
            bottom: -2px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #3b82f6, #10b981, #3b82f6);
            border-radius: 8px;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
            z-index: -1;
            background-size: 200% 200%;
            animation: gradientShift 3s ease infinite;
        }

        @keyframes gradientShift {
            0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
        }

        .team-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .team-name {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .team-role {
            color: #3b82f6;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .platform-card {
            background: #111827;
            border: 1px solid #1f2937;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #e4e7ec;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .platform-card::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: -100%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2), transparent);
            transition: left 0.5s;
        }

        .platform-card:hover::after {
            left: 100%;
        }

        .platform-card:hover {
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .platform-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .platform-desc {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .vip-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.15), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15));
            border: 2px solid #8a2be2;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 3rem;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            max-width: 900px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.3);
        }

        .vip-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .vip-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #c084fc;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .vip-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #60a5fa;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .vip-content {
            color: #e4e7ec;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .vip-steps {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .vip-step {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .vip-step:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .vip-step h4 {
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .vip-step p {
            color: #9ca3af;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .vip-step ul {
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .payment-details {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            border-left: 3px solid #10b981;
        }

        .payment-details p {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #e4e7ec;
        }

        .payment-details strong {
            color: #60a5fa;
        }

        .earning-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15));
            border: 2px solid #3b82f6;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 3rem;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            max-width: 900px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .earning-section {
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .earning-section:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .earning-section h3 {
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .earning-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        .earning-list li {
            padding: 0.75rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: #e4e7ec;
        }

        .earning-list li:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .earning-note {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .rewards-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .rewards-table th,
        .rewards-table td {
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .rewards-table th {
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .rewards-table td {
            color: #e4e7ec;
        }

        .rewards-table tr:hover {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
        }

        .highlight-text {
            color: #10b981;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .warning-text {
            color: #f59e0b;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .download-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1));
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 2rem auto 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .download-box::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1), transparent);
            animation: shine 3s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes shine {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .download-title {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .download-desc {
            color: #9ca3af;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        footer {
            background: #050810;
            border-top: 1px solid #1a2234;
            margin-top: 4rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .footer-content {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .footer-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .footer-text {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .footer-links {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .footer-links li {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #9ca3af;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .footer-links a::before {
            content: '→';
            position: absolute;
            left: -15px;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: #3b82f6;
            padding-left: 15px;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
            left: 0;
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #1a2234;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .social-icon {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: #1a2234;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #9ca3af;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .social-icon:hover {
            background: #3b82f6;
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-3px) rotate(5deg);
        }

        .fade-in-section {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
            transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
        }

        .fade-in-section.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }

            .mobile-toggle {
                display: block;
            }

            .grid-3 {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .footer-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }

            .footer-bottom {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            .stats-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="#" class="logo">DDS</a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#vip">VIP Access</a></li>
                <li><a href="#earning">Earn Rewards</a></li>
                <li><a href="#team">Team</a></li>
                <li><a href="#download">Download</a></li>
            </ul>
            <button class="mobile-toggle">
                <i class="fas fa-bars"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Dark Digital Space</h1>
        <p>A specialized digital forum for global gatherings of tech enthusiasts. We're a community of tech brothers and sisters in an ideological cyber technology development forum - not just social media, but a place of innovation, skills development, and entertainment with lesser boundaries towards cyber media.</p>
        
        <div class="hero-highlight">
            <p><strong>Our Mission:</strong> DDS serves as a hub for individuals interested in cybersecurity, ethical hacking, and programming. We emphasize knowledge sharing, skill development, and ethical conduct while fostering a community that values learning, innovation, and responsible engagement with technology. We are here to contribute to the Nigerian tech ecosystem with innovative minds and skills. <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/CZ6igT4YgWrK5mK1Mffjfh" target="_blank" style="color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: underline;">Join us</a> - no schemes, just engagement strings and development.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#download" class="btn btn-primary">
                <span><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download DDS</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbAQP858kyyPVm8gDL0F" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">
                <span><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Join Channel</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/CZ6igT4YgWrK5mK1Mffjfh" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">
                <span><i class="fas fa-heart"></i> Support Us</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fade-in-section">
        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="stat-number">1000+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Active Members</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="stat-number">500+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Projects Completed</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="stat-number">24/7</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Community Support</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="stat-number">100%</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Free Access</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="fade-in-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">What is DDS?</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">A specialized digital forum for tech enthusiasts passionate about cybersecurity and innovation</p>
        <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="card-title">Tech Community Forum</h3>
                <p class="card-text">A specialized digital forum bringing together tech brothers and sisters globally. We're not a social media platform - we're an ideological cyber technology development community focused on real growth.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="card-title">Knowledge Sharing Hub</h3>
                <p class="card-text">Share knowledge, skills, and entertainment related to cybersecurity, ethical hacking, and programming. Educational and recreational interactions that emphasize ethical conduct and media security.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="card-title">Skills Development</h3>
                <p class="card-text">No schemes - just engagement strings and development on both skills and entertainment. We help one another grow through practical learning and real-world tech applications.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="card-title">Lesser Boundaries</h3>
                <p class="card-text">A place of lesser boundaries towards cyber media where innovation thrives. Explore cybersecurity concepts in a safe, collaborative environment focused on responsible engagement.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="card-title">Nigerian Tech Contribution</h3>
                <p class="card-text">Contributing to the Nigerian tech ecosystem with innovative minds and skills. Building a community that values learning, innovation, and ethical technology practices.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="card-title">Global Tech Network</h3>
                <p class="card-text">Facilitating global gatherings of individuals interested in cybersecurity and programming. A system for all tech-related members, especially those into programming or all-around cyber development.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="team" class="fade-in-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Meet Our Leadership</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">The visionaries building Nigeria's cyber security community</p>
        <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card team-card">
                <h3 class="team-name">Jp</h3>
                <div class="team-role">Founder & Owner</div>
                <a href="https://wa.me/2348087395751" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">
                    <span><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Contact</span>
